    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "i haven't heard of that \"24-Lock\" thing before... sounds a bit niche. can you just stick to the standard math? like, if i know my average daily demand and the standard deviation of my lead time, how do i combine those to get the safety stock number? i need something i can actually plug into an excel sheet.",
